Package: drama-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libcuda1, libcudart12, libcublas12
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/drama-rs
Description: Fish Audio Drama 3 text-to-speech on a single 24 GB GPU (CUDA)
 drama speaks text with Fish Audio Drama 3 (a 35B-total / 3B-active MoE
 backbone plus the Fish DAC codec), with voice cloning from a reference
 clip and streaming playback. Needs an NVIDIA GPU with 24 GB of memory
 (Ampere or newer) and the int4 weights, ~21 GB, from Hugging Face
 (apiplant/drama-q4). libcuda1 (installed by the NVIDIA driver package)
 satisfies the runtime link; it does not by itself guarantee
 driver/toolkit compatibility.
